":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79174","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"96930","synopsis":"謎の男「ヤン」が駆るLEVの襲撃を壮絶な機動性で撃退したドロレス。だが、何も分からぬまま彼女に搭乗したジェイムズは、この事件が元で殺人犯として地球圏から追われるハメに陥ってしまう。","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79174/304665.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"412","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"31026","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79174","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"96931","synopsis":"ドロレスの音声プログラムに刻まれた不可思議な声。それはレイチェルがジェイムズに託した「ドロレスを誰にも渡さないで」というメッセージだった。5年前に火星で死んだと思っていた妻が生きているのか……。ドロレスを問いつめるジェイムズ。しかし、それ以上の記録は彼女に残されてはいなかった。","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79174/304666.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"412","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"31026","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79174","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"96932","synopsis":"ドロレスやレイチェルにまつわる様々な謎を解き、事態を収拾する為火星へ向かうことを決めたジェイムズ。そんな彼が厳重な警戒網が敷かれた軌道エレベーターに代わり、宇宙に上る手段として目を付けたのは、博物館に置かれた廃棄寸前の展示ロケット・フューチャーだった。","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79174/304667.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"412","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"31026","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79174","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"96933","synopsis":"大気圏を離脱したロケットの進路で待ち構えるワイヤードのLEVを薙ぎ払う為、危険を承知でドロレスで出撃するジェイムズ。しかし、彼らを待ち構えていたのは、LEV編隊を瞬時の内に破壊した謎の機体、第2のヤンが操るラプター型のオービタルフレームだった。奇妙な感覚に襲われ、ヤン機と戦う事を嫌がるドロレス。それはプログラムの奥底に刻まれた「指令」なのだろうか。そして熾烈な戦闘の果て、窮地に追い込まれたドロレスの中で、ついに彼女のもう一つの人格、「イシス」が目覚める。","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79174/304668.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"412","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"31026","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79174","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"96934","synopsis":"廃棄衛星の罠で満身創痍となったドロレスは、セントラルステーションに辿り着くや、眠るように機能を停止してしまった。……そんなドロレスが隠されたドックが間近にある事を知らず、捕らえたレオンを拷問にかけ、ドロレスの居場所を吐かせようとする第2のヤン。これまで父の妄言だと思っていた様々な事件の「真実」を知り、レオンは愕然する。","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79174/304669.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"412","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"31026","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79174","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"96935","synopsis":"ワイヤードの執拗な追撃から逃れる為、ジェイムズ達はザルガスと呼ばれるコロニーへ向かった。そこは裏社会の人間すら脅える、地球圏最悪のシンジケート「レッド・ハーベスト」の本拠地。密輸で稼いでいる連中なら、非合法なウーレンベックカタパルトを持っているはず。と判断し、それを借り火星圏まで一気に向かおうと考えた。","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79174/304670.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"412","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"31026","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79174","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"96936","synopsis":"James, Leon, Noel, and Dolores attempt to escape toward Mars, where they suspect Rachel is.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79174/304671.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"412","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"31026","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79174","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"96937","synopsis":"As the Links family continue their voyage to Mars, they discover a serious problem - they don't have enough fuel!! Now, James must make the ultimate decision to save Leon and Noel...","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79174/304672.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"412","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"31026","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79174","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"96938","synopsis":"Realizing that there isn’t enough fuel to reach Mars, James must make the ultimate decision... that is until Dolores stumbles across a hidden space station!","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79174/304673.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"412","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"31026","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79174","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"96939","synopsis":"After a scuffle with a satellite, James, Noel, Leon, and Dolores hide out in a garbage dump right outside of Mars. James soon comes up with a plan to hide their ship in garbage and try to enter the atmosphere, hoping to be undetected... that is if they can pull it off!","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79174/304674.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 12","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"412","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"31026","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79174","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"96940","synopsis":"James, Leon, Noel, and Dolores land on Mars at last. They are \"shipwrekced\" in the ocean and are rescued by two people who have made it their job t protect Mars and its progress into a new \"Earth\". Little does James and the others know, they have just landed into a conflict between their new friends and the group opposing them.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79174/304675.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 13","episodeNumber":13,"sourceEpisodeNumber":13,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"412","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"31026","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79174","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[13]}],"link":"96941","synopsis":"James and company manage to find land. After surviving the harshness of a Mars night, the four find a \"greenhouse\" with oxygen and two people. Who are the old man and child and what are they doing there? And, what will happen when the greenhouse comes under attack?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79174/304676.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 14","episodeNumber":14,"sourceEpisodeNumber":14,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"412","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"31026","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79174","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[14]}],"link":"96942","synopsis":"After defeating a mech, James opens up the cockpit and discovers that the pilot is actually a young girl named Rebecca Hunter. She attempts to blow up the mech, killing both of them, but James manages to escape, saving her in the process. With Dolores, the three head to an abandoned Energy Plant. There, James treats Rebecca with kindness, giving her food and allowing her to take a bath. However, she soon manages to cut off all the power and escape with Dolores. Will she make it back to her squad? Will James survive without any oxygen, or will he find a way out?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79174/304677.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 15","episodeNumber":15,"sourceEpisodeNumber":15,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"412","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"31026","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79174","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[15]}],"link":"96943","synopsis":"James, Rebecca, and Dolores attempt to find humanity. They eventually do, although it isn't whom James expected. Can James shake Rebecca's friends and still manage to drop her off safely? Meanwhile, Leon and Noel find a town thanks to a man named Nikolai. But, is he friend or foe? And, what plot does Cindy have in mind?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79174/304678.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 16","episodeNumber":16,"sourceEpisodeNumber":16,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"412","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[16]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[16]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[16]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"31026","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[16]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79174","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[16]}],"link":"96945","synopsis":"Rebecca is back at the base, but all is not well. A powerful man comes and challenges her to a duel. It is interrupted, however, when the Earth forces arrive looking for James Links. Afterwards, Rebecca visits an important woman.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79174/304679.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 17","episodeNumber":17,"sourceEpisodeNumber":17,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"412","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[17]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[17]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[17]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"31026","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[17]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79174","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[17]}],"link":"96944","synopsis":"With barely any fuel left and a dearth of oxygen, James volunteers to trek in the sand storm for 24 hours to the next town. The good news is that he stumbles across a town less then half way. Even better, he meets his idol Isaac Barrett in the town. But, the good times are short lived.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79174/304680.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 18","episodeNumber":18,"sourceEpisodeNumber":18,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"412","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[18]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[18]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[18]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"31026","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[18]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79174","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[18]}],"link":"96946","synopsis":"Nikolai captures Noel and challenges James to a duel. Will James be able to win? And, why does Nikolai hate James so much?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79174/304681.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 19","episodeNumber":19,"sourceEpisodeNumber":19,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"412","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[19]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[19]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[19]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"31026","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[19]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79174","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[19]}],"link":"96947","synopsis":"The Links Family finally come within feet of where Rachel is. James and Dolores cause a massive distraction, as Leon and the others sneak in and track down Rachel. Will they find her? And, will everyone be able to escape alive?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79174/304682.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 20","episodeNumber":20,"sourceEpisodeNumber":20,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"412","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[20]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[20]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[20]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"31026","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[20]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79174","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[20]}],"link":"96948","synopsis":"Rachel fills the rest of the gang in on the situation and what Dolores actually is. Menahwile, Naphth Pleminger learns that Isis is now calling itself Dolores. Upon hearing this, Naphth gets angry, proving that he may be more then who he seems.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79174/304683.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 21","episodeNumber":21,"sourceEpisodeNumber":21,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"412","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[21]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[21]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[21]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"31026","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[21]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79174","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[21]}],"link":"96949","synopsis":"War has begun! Leon figures out their plan via Nikolai's left over files. With the information at hand, can the Links family pass it on to the Earth Forces? And, when James and Dolores head out, what trouble will they find? Civilizations are still present, yet a battlefield surrounds them.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79174/304684.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 22","episodeNumber":22,"sourceEpisodeNumber":22,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"412","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[22]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[22]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[22]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"31026","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[22]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79174","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[22]}],"link":"96951","synopsis":"After Sameji overthrows Van, James and Radium face off. What is Radium's plan? Will James win against him, or is he just walking into a trap?!","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79174/304685.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 23","episodeNumber":23,"sourceEpisodeNumber":23,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"412","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[23]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[23]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[23]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"31026","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[23]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79174","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[23]}],"link":"96950","synopsis":"After waking up in a hospital bed, James informs everyone that Radium intends to drop the orbital elevator on Earth. The only way to stop him is to convince Earth and Mars to cooperate with each other. Will James be able to do it? And, with Dolores still out of commission, can James bring her back to how she was? Is there hope? Or, will Radium succeed?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79174/304686.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 24","episodeNumber":24,"sourceEpisodeNumber":24,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"412","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[24]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[24]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[24]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"31026","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[24]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79174","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[24]}],"link":"96953","synopsis":"James and the crew head toward Earth in hopes of catching up with Radium. However, when they get close, they discover that it's too late. James goes on ahead with Dolores and the two enter in the middle of a fierce battle. Meanwhile, Leon is put in charge of the ship and must make an important decision.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79174/304687.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 25","episodeNumber":25,"sourceEpisodeNumber":25,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"412","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[25]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[25]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[25]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"31026","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[25]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79174","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[25]}],"link":"96952","synopsis":"James manages to save Rebecca, and Dolores saves James. James lectures Rebecca, attempting to open up her eyes. Will he get through to her? Does he even have time? Meanwhile, Leon and the others have trouble of their own, as they have to purge two levels of the orbital elevator to maintain balance. What's worse, they have to do it manually! Will Leon and Noel succeed? The situation is dire, as James and Radium face off! Who will be victorious?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79174/304688.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 26","episodeNumber":26,"sourceEpisodeNumber":26,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"412","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[26]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[26]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1249","episodeNumbers":[26]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"31026","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[26]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79174","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[26]}],"link":"96954","synopsis":"James and Radium's fight comes to a thrilling conclusion. With that all said and done, however, the end is not near. The elevator is still descending, and at this rate, there's nothing that can be done. Dolores decides to take matters into her own hands and sacrifice her own life to stop the elevator from falling! Will she go through with it? Will her power be enough? Will she survive? And, what has become of Rebecca and Axel? The enthralling conclusion of Zone of the Enders has arrived!!","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.c